ather David,","1:33":"and He will reign over the house of Jacob forever. His kingdom will never end!”","1:34":"“How can this be,” Mary asked the angel, “since I am a virgin?”","1:35":"The angel replied, “The Holy Spirit will come upon you, and the power of the Most High will overshadow you. So the Holy One to be born will be called the Son of God.","1:36":"Look, even Elizabeth your relative has conceived a son in her old age, and she who was called barren is in her sixth month.","1:37":"For no word from God will ever fail.”","1:38":"“I am the Lord’s servant,” Mary answered. “May it happen to me according to your word.” Then the angel left her."}}},"pairs":{},"minor":[]}